# how a Make Waves call cue card (with "do not say" notes) got written in here on 08-05.
*cuecard*.html
*CALL_PREP*
*_PRIVATE.*
JENNA_CALL_PREP.md
jenna-call-cuecard.html
SHARED_ENGINE.md
CREATOR_ECONOMICS.md
FOUNDERS_CLUB.md
MAINNET_CUTOVER_CHECKLIST.md
.firecrawl/
